§ `P6: the printed per-person rates are not multiples of ten shekels`

-- 19. The notice prints 2.05 shekels for the rate of 2, and rounding that rate to the nearest ten shekels gives nothing.
#ASSERT `the rate the notice prints is what rounding it to the nearest ten shekels gives` (`rate: 2 shekels, section 23כו(ד)(1)`)
-- 20. The notice prints 4.09 shekels for the rate of 4, and rounding that rate to the nearest ten shekels gives nothing.
#ASSERT `the rate the notice prints is what rounding it to the nearest ten shekels gives` (`rate: 4 shekels, section 23כו(ה)(1)`)
